      "end_line": 81,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.LabelSegmentedControl {\n    method: function(eventData) { syncSelectionModel() }\n\n    LV.LabelButton { text: \"A\" }\n    LV.LabelButton { text: \"B\" }\n}\n```\n",
